<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάραξις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[χᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incision, mark,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				23
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χ. τοῦ ἀρότρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theognost.
					<u>Can.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τροχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁματροχιάς; τοῦ τροχοῦ</span>
			, = Lat. <i>orbita,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>erasure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLips.
				10 ii 4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of acute pain, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ βηχὸς ἴσχει τραχύτητας καὶ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.698c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>coining, minting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λεπτοῦ χαλκοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					485.12
				</span></i>
			 (Magn.Mae.).</div>
